1
00:00:01,458 --> 00:00:04,333
I never thought we'd meet
as sisters like this.

2
00:00:06,166 --> 00:00:07,750
Mayura, please stop.

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:10,458
I know how deeply you cared
about Masaki.

4
00:00:11,291 --> 00:00:15,666
But I felt the same. I've always
cared about you and Mayuki.

5
00:00:15,666 --> 00:00:17,000
Please, Mayura...

6
00:00:19,583 --> 00:00:23,291
Mayura, you keep looking
only at those who are gone.

7
00:00:23,708 --> 00:00:25,916
You won't even see
what matters more.

8
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,250
Are you... my sister?

9
00:00:47,416 --> 00:00:48,458
Mayuki...

10
00:00:50,708 --> 00:00:52,666
Sis! Sis!

11
00:00:53,916 --> 00:00:55,583
Mayuki...

12
00:00:58,125 --> 00:01:00,750
But... it's too late.

13
00:01:08,791 --> 00:01:09,166
Mayura...

14
00:01:09,541 --> 00:01:09,916
What!?

15
00:01:10,458 --> 00:01:11,416
Mayura!

16
00:01:21,666 --> 00:01:23,041
Mayuki...

17
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:27,250
Mayura, those three candles
you lit at the temporary shrine...

18
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:31,500
They helped me work out
who the Mountain Child's Messenger was.

19
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:34,250
But weren't they also
a sign of your kindness?

20
00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:37,791
You prayed for the dead. I can't
believe you're a heartless killer.

21
00:01:37,791 --> 00:01:41,083
I want to believe
those prayers were sincere.

22
00:01:41,083 --> 00:01:43,416
Mayura, you have to live.
For Mayuki and Sayuri.

23
00:01:43,416 --> 00:01:49,375
Isn't that why Masaki appeared
to you once more? To tell you that?

24
00:01:51,416 --> 00:01:53,000
Kindaichi...

25
00:02:19,333 --> 00:02:23,250
The Devil's Mouth is going back
to sleep... along with Masaki.

26
00:02:23,708 --> 00:02:26,666
Now the treasure will be
sealed away forever...

27
00:02:26,666 --> 00:02:31,291
...the clock in Mayura's heart
has started ticking again.

28
00:02:32,125 --> 00:02:35,041
And this time, it won't stop.

29
00:02:40,166 --> 00:02:42,583
Thank you, Mayura.

30
00:02:46,083 --> 00:02:47,458
Big brother...
